OL,5,G2300 Trauma Room One
OL,6,     FJames, 63, is losing feeling and
OL,7,     Ffunction in his hands and fingers.
OL,8,     FSurgeons must act fast to remove
OL,9,     Fdisc and bone from his neck. Will
OL,10,     Fthey save James from an uncertain
OL,11,     Ffuture? (Ep8)
OL,12,G0000 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FA forehead lump isn't what it
OL,14,     Fseems for Dr Magnus. Dr Emma
OL,15,     Fassists - or rather de-cysts - an
OL,16,     F80-year-old patient wanting to
OL,17,     Flook her best for her grandson's
OL,18,     Fwedding.
